cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use QueryWitness, cite this software and record the exact version,
  commit, SQLite runtime, catalog hash, comparison policy, and experiment budget.
type: software
title: "QueryWitness: Bounded SQLite Counterexample Search and Replay"
version: 0.1.0
authors:
  - name: "loaff123"
    website: "https://github.com/loaff123"
repository-code: "https://github.com/loaff123/querywitness"
url: "https://github.com/loaff123/querywitness"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A local Python tool for bounded differential testing of SQLite query pairs,
  schema-valid synthetic instance generation, constraint-preserving row
  reduction, and replayable counterexample artifacts. Includes a 12-family
  original synthetic regression catalog and an equal-trial-budget evaluation
  runner. Finding no counterexample within a finite budget does not prove equivalence.
keywords:
  - SQL
  - SQLite
  - differential testing
  - counterexamples
  - reproducibility
